 pure OLED pitch black (#000000) and replace all blue modal backgrounds with pure black cards (#050505 / #0a0a0a) with sleek gold/emerald accents.","ReplacementContent":"    /* High-End OLED Pitch Black Welcome Modal */\n    .welcome-overlay {\n      position: fixed;\n      top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(24px);\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      z-index: 9999;\n      animation: modalFadeIn 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n    }\n    @keyframes modalFadeIn {\n      from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.96); }\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }\n    }\n    .welcome-modal {\n      width: 92%;\n      max-width: 1120px;\n      max-height: 90vh;\n      background: #050505;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      border-radius: 18px;\n      box-shadow: 0 30px 90px #000000, inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      padding: 28px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      color: #f1f5f9;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 22px;\n    }\n    .welcome-header {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      padding-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n    .pie-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(330px, 1fr));\n      gap: 22px;\n    }\n    .pie-card {\n      background: #0a0a0c;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      padding: 20px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 14px;\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px #000000;\n      transition: all 0.25s ease;\n    }\n    .pie-card::before {\n      content: '';\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px;\n      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #00ff88, transparent);\n      opacity: 0.8;\n    }\n    .pie-card:hover {\n      border-color: rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.4);\n      transform: translateY(-3px);\n      box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.1);\n    }\n    .pie-card-title {\n      font-size: 13.5px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #00ff88;\n      letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n      text-align: center;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.3);\n    }\n    .pie-card-desc {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      text-align: center;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n    .pie-legend {\n      width: 100%;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 7px;\n      margin-top: 6px;\n    }\n    .legend-row {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      font-size: 10.5px;\n      padding: 5px 10px;\n      background: #121215;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      transition: background 0.15s ease;\n    }\n    .legend-row:hover {\n      background: #18181c;\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n    }\n    .legend-label {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      color: #cbd5e1;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n    .legend-dot {\n      width: 10px;\n      height: 10px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 8px currentColor;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Initial Welcome Modal Overlay: 3 Statistical Pie Charts -->\n  <div class=\"welcome-overlay\" id=\"welcomeModalOverlay\">\n    <div class=\"welcome-modal\">\n      <div class=\"welcome-header\">\n        <div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:900; color:#00ff88; letter-spacing:0.5px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n            <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00ff88\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M21.21 15.89A10 10 0 1 1 8 2.83\"></path><path d=\"M22 12A10 10 0 0 0 12 2v10z\"></path></svg>\n            SISTEMA SOCIOECOLÓGICO DE KENNEDY — METRÍCAS ECOLÓGICAS Y MATRIZ DE EVIDENCIA\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:11px; color:#94a3b8; margin-top:2px;\">Distribución funcional, composición taxonómica y respaldo técnico del modelo (180 taxones)</div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"btn-flat active\" style=\"padding:8px 18px; font-weight:800; font-size:12px; border-color:#00ff88; color:#00ff88; background:rgba(0,255,136,0.1);\" onclick=\"closeWelcomeModal()\">\n          Explorar Red 3D →\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"pie-grid\">\n        <!-- Torta A: Distribución por Tipos de Interacción Biótica -->\n        <div class=\"pie-card\">\n          <div class=\"pie-card-title\">1. Torta A: Distribución por Tipos de Interacción Biótica</div>\n          <div class=\"pie-card-desc\">Representa cómo se distribuyen las relaciones funcionales registradas en la red socioecológica de Kennedy.</div>\n          \n          <!-- SVG Pie Chart A -->\n          <svg width=\"150\" height=\"150\" viewBox=\"-1.1 -1.1 2.2 2.2\" style=\"transform: rotate(-90deg);\">\n            <!-- Visita Floral / Polinización 39.18% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L 1 0 A 1 1 0 0 1 -0.584 0.812 Z\" fill=\"#d000ff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n            <!-- Herbivoría Parcial 31.58% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L -0.584 0.812 A 1 1 0 0 1 -0.892 -0.452 Z\" fill=\"#00ff88\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n            <!-- Nidificación y Refugio 7.44% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L -0.892 -0.452 A 1 1 0 0 1 -0.669 -0.743 Z\" fill=\"#ffaa00\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n            <!-- Dispersión de Semillas 4.88% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L -0.669 -0.743 A 1 1 0 0 1 -0.463 -0.886 Z\" fill=\"#ff80a0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n            <!-- Parasitismo / Depredación / Epibiosis 16.92% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L -0.463 -0.886 A 1 1 0 0 1 1 0 Z\" fill=\"#ff0033\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n          </svg>\n\n          <div class=\"pie-legend\">\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#d000ff;\"></div>Visita Floral / Polinización</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#d000ff;\">39.18%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#00ff88;\"></div>Herbivoría Parcial</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#00ff88;\">31.58%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#ffaa00;\"></div>Nidificación y Refugio</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#ffaa00;\">7.44%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#ff80a0;\"></div>Dispersión de Semillas</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#ff80a0;\">4.88%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#ff0033;\"></div>Parasitismo / Depredación / Epibiosis</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#ff0033;\">16.92%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:8.5px; color:#64748b; margin-top:2px; text-align:center;\">(Desglose: Parásitos 4.92%, Epibiosis 4.69%, Predación 4.60%)</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Torta B: Composición por Reinos Taxonómicos -->\n        <div class=\"pie-card\">\n          <div class=\"pie-card-title\">🌿 2. Torta B: Composición por Reinos Taxonómicos</div>\n          <div class=\"pie-card-desc\">Muestra el peso proporcional de los reinos biológicos y componentes en la matriz ambiental.</div>\n          \n          <!-- SVG Pie Chart B -->\n          <svg width=\"150\" height=\"150\" viewBox=\"-1.1 -1.1 2.2 2.2\" style=\"transform: rotate(-90deg);\">\n            <!-- Plantae 59.5% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L 1 0 A 1 1 0 1 1 -0.560 -0.828 Z\" fill=\"#10B981\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n            <!-- Animalia 30.4% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L -0.560 -0.828 A 1 1 0 0 1 0.887 -0.462 Z\" fill=\"#38BDF8\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n            <!-- Fungi 7.0% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L 0.887 -0.462 A 1 1 0 0 1 0.988 -0.156 Z\" fill=\"#F43F5E\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n            <!-- Bacterias y Protistas 3.1% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L 0.988 -0.156 A 1 1 0 0 1 1 0 Z\" fill=\"#FACC15\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n          </svg>\n\n          <div class=\"pie-legend\">\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#10B981;\"></div>Plantae (Flora Nativa e Invasora)</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#10B981;\">59.5%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#38BDF8;\"></div>Animalia (Avifauna, Herpetos, MAM)</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#38BDF8;\">30.4%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#F43F5E;\"></div>Fungi (Hongos y Micorrizas)</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#F43F5E;\">7.0%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#FACC15;\"></div>Bacterias y Protistas (Biofiltro)</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#FACC15;\">3.1%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:8.5px; color:#64748b; margin-top:2px; text-align:center;\">(Desglose: Bacterias 1.7%, Protistas 1.4%)</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Torta C: Origen y Soporte de Fuentes de Evidencia -->\n        <div class=\"pie-card\">\n          <div class=\"pie-card-title\">📜 3. Torta C: Origen y Soporte de Fuentes de Evidencia</div>\n          <div class=\"pie-card-desc\">Demuestra el respaldo técnico del modelo socioecológico a partir del origen del dato.</div>\n          \n          <!-- SVG Pie Chart C -->\n          <svg width=\"150\" height=\"150\" viewBox=\"-1.1 -1.1 2.2 2.2\" style=\"transform: rotate(-90deg);\">\n            <!-- Artículos Científicos 36.1% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L 1 0 A 1 1 0 0 1 -0.741 0.672 Z\" fill=\"#00ff88\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n            <!-- Registros Multimedia de Campo 25.8% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L -0.741 0.672 A 1 1 0 0 1 -0.722 -0.692 Z\" fill=\"#ffee33\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n            <!-- Colecciones y Censo SIGAU 23.4% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L -0.722 -0.692 A 1 1 0 0 1 0.584 -0.812 Z\" fill=\"#ff007f\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n            <!-- Literatura Gris / PMA 9.7% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L 0.584 -0.812 A 1 1 0 0 1 0.951 -0.309 Z\" fill=\"#ffaa00\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n            <!-- Libros y Ciencia Participativa 5.0% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L 0.951 -0.309 A 1 1 0 0 1 1 0 Z\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n          </svg>\n\n          <div class=\"pie-legend\">\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#00ff88;\"></div>Artículos Científicos</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#00ff88;\">36.1%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#ffee33;\"></div>Registros Multimedia de Campo</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#ffee33;\">25.8%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#ff007f;\"></div>Colecciones y Censo SIGAU</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#ff007f;\">23.4%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#ffaa00;\"></div>Literatura Gris / PMA Humedales</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#ffaa00;\">9.7%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#38bdf8;\"></div>Libros y Ciencia Participativa</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#38bdf8;\">5.0%</b>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding-top:14px;\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:10.5px; color:#94a3b8;\">💡 Puedes volver a abrir estas gráficas estadísticas en cualquier momento con el botón \"📊 Métricas\" del menú superior.</span>\n        <button class=\"btn-flat active\" style=\"padding:9px 24px; font-size:12px; font-weight:800; background:#00ff88; color:#000000; border:none;\" onclick=\"closeWelcomeModal()\">\n          Entendido, Ingresar al Visor 3D\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Navigation Header -->\n  <div class=\"top-header\">\n    <div class=\"nav-group\">\n      <div class=\"glass-panel brand-title\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00ff88\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"5\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"19\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M12 9L19 5M12 15L5 19\"></path></svg>\n        SISTEMA SOCIOECOLÓGICO KENNEDY\n      </div>\n\n      <button class=\"glass-panel btn-flat active\" style=\"border-color:#00ff88; color:#00ff88;\" onclick=\"openWelcomeModal()\">\n        <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M21.21 15.89A10 10 0 1 1 8 2.83\"></path><path d=\"M22 12A10 10 0 0 0 12 2v10z\"></path></svg>\n        📊 Métricas (Tortas A, B, C)\n      </button>","StartLine":547,"TargetContent":"    /* High-End Luxury Cyberpunk Glassmorphism Welcome Modal */\n    .welcome-overlay {\n      position: fixed;\n      top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;\n      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.92), rgba(2, 4, 8, 0.98));\n      backdrop-filter: blur(24px);\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      z-index: 9999;\n      animation: modalFadeIn 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n    }\n    @keyframes modalFadeIn {\n      from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.96); }\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }\n    }\n    .welcome-modal {\n      width: 92%;\n      max-width: 1120px;\n      max-height: 90vh;\n      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(13, 20, 36, 0.95), rgba(6, 10, 20, 0.98));\n      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.35);\n      border-radius: 18px;\n      box-shadow: 0 30px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15), 0 0 45px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      padding: 28px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      color: #f1f5f9;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 22px;\n    }\n    .welcome-header {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      padding-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n    .pie-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(330px, 1fr));\n      gap: 22px;\n    }\n    .pie-card {\n      background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(20, 30, 52, 0.65), rgba(10, 16, 30, 0.85));\n      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.18);\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      padding: 20px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 14px;\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n      transition: all 0.25s ease;\n    }\n    .pie-card::before {\n      content: '';\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px;\n      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #00ffff, transparent);\n      opacity: 0.7;\n    }\n    .pie-card:hover {\n      border-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.5);\n      transform: translateY(-3px);\n      box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.15);\n    }\n    .pie-card-title {\n      font-size: 13.5px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #00ffff;\n      letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n      text-align: center;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.4);\n    }\n    .pie-card-desc {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      text-align: center;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n    .pie-legend {\n      width: 100%;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 7px;\n      margin-top: 6px;\n    }\n    .legend-row {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      font-size: 10.5px;\n      padding: 5px 10px;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      transition: background 0.15s ease;\n    }\n    .legend-row:hover {\n      background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      border-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\n    }\n    .legend-label {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      color: #cbd5e1;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n    .legend-dot {\n      width: 100%;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 7px;\n      margin-top: 6px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Initial Welcome Modal Overlay: 3 Statistical Pie Charts -->\n  <div class=\"welcome-overlay\" id=\"welcomeModalOverlay\">\n    <div class=\"welcome-modal\">\n      <div class=\"welcome-header\">\n        <div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:900; color:#00ffff; letter-spacing:0.5px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n            <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M21.21 15.89A10 10 0 1 1 8 2.83\"></path><path d=\"M22 12A10 10 0 0 0 12 2v10z\"></path></svg>\n            SISTEMA SOCIOECOLÓGICO DE KENNEDY — METRÍCAS ECOLÓGICAS Y MATRIZ DE EVIDENCIA\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:11px; color:#94a3b8; margin-top:2px;\">Distribución funcional, composición taxonómica y respaldo técnico del modelo (180 taxones)</div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"btn-flat active\" style=\"padding:8px 18px; font-weight:800; font-size:12px;\" onclick=\"closeWelcomeModal()\">\n          Explorar Red 3D →\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"pie-grid\">\n        <!-- Torta A: Distribución por Tipos de Interacción Biótica -->\n        <div class=\"pie-card\">\n          <div class=\"pie-card-title\">1. Torta A: Distribución por Tipos de Interacción Biótica</div>\n          <div class=\"pie-card-desc\">Representa cómo se distribuyen las relaciones funcionales registradas en la red socioecológica de Kennedy.</div>\n          \n          <!-- SVG Pie Chart A -->\n          <svg width=\"150\" height=\"150\" viewBox=\"-1.1 -1.1 2.2 2.2\" style=\"transform: rotate(-90deg);\">\n            <!-- Visita Floral / Polinización 39.18% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L 1 0 A 1 1 0 0 1 -0.584 0.812 Z\" fill=\"#d000ff\" stroke=\"#0a0f1a\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n            <!-- Herbivoría Parcial 31.58% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L -0.584 0.812 A 1 1 0 0 1 -0.892 -0.452 Z\" fill=\"#00ff88\" stroke=\"#0a0f1a\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n            <!-- Nidificación y Refugio 7.44% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L -0.892 -0.452 A 1 1 0 0 1 -0.669 -0.743 Z\" fill=\"#ffaa00\" stroke=\"#0a0f1a\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n            <!-- Dispersión de Semillas 4.88% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L -0.669 -0.743 A 1 1 0 0 1 -0.463 -0.886 Z\" fill=\"#ff80a0\" stroke=\"#0a0f1a\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n            <!-- Parasitismo / Depredación / Epibiosis 16.92% -->\n            <path d=\"M 0 0 L -0.463 -0.886 A 1 1 0 0 1 1 0 Z\" fill=\"#ff0033\" stroke=\"#0a0f1a\" stroke-width=\"0.02\"/>\n          </svg>\n\n          <div class=\"pie-legend\">\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#d000ff;\"></div>Visita Floral / Polinización</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#d000ff;\">39.18%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#00ff88;\"></div>Herbivoría Parcial</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#00ff88;\">31.58%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#ffaa00;\"></div>Nidificación y Refugio</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#ffaa00;\">7.44%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#ff80a0;\"></div>Dispersión de Semillas</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#ff80a0;\">4.88%</b>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <div class=\"legend-label\"><div class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background:#ff0033;\"></div>Parasitismo / Depredación / Epibiosis</div>\n              <b style=\"color:#ff0033;\">16.92%</b>\n   